\b \cf2 On how verse 14 goes beyond the parable structure:
\b0 \
The parable in verses 3-13 uses their imagery against them. It takes their 
\f2 \uc0\u1502 \u1464 \u1513 \u1464 \u1473 \u1500 
\f1  about the pot and fills it with judgment. But verse 14 steps outside the parable:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl280\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 \uc0\u1488 \u1458 \u1504 \u1460 \u1497 
\f1  
