\f1  - "I, YHWH, have spoken"\
This isn't metaphor. This is direct divine declaration. The "I" speaking is not the pot or the cook or any figure in the parable. It's YHWH Himself breaking frame to address the audience directly.\

\f2 \uc0\u1489 \u1464 \u1468 \u1488 \u1464 \u1492 
