The shift from parable to announcement. Not "the pot will be destroyed" but "I will do it." The metaphorical distance collapses. Whatever the parable represents, YHWH directly claims responsibility for what's coming.\

\f2 \uc0\u1500 \u1465 \u1488 \u1470 \u1488 \u1462 \u1508 \u1456 \u1512 \u1463 \u1506 
