\f1  - "the delight of your/their eyes." YHWH takes both.\
But the temple's loss is described with a specific verb: 
\f2 \uc0\u1492 \u1460 \u1504 \u1456 \u1504 \u1460 \u1497 
\f1  
\f2 \uc0\u1502 \u1456 \u1495 \u1463 \u1500 \u1461 \u1468 \u1500 
