In chapter 12, Ezekiel was also 
\f2 \uc0\u1502 \u1493 \u1465 \u1508 \u1461 \u1514 
\f1  when he dug through the wall and carried his baggage out at night, acting out exile.\
The 
\f2 \uc0\u1502 \u1493 \u1465 \u1508 \u1461 \u1514 
\f1  is an embodied prophecy. Not just words about what will happen, but enacted demonstration. The audience watches someone DO what they will do.\
In chapter 12:6 - 
\f2 \uc0\u1493 \u1468 \u1500 \u1456 \u1506 \u1461 \u1497 \u1504 \u1461 \u1497 \u1492 \u1462 \u1501 
