\cf2 What I'm less certain about:\
Does the text support reading Ezekiel's non-mourning as itself hopeful - as demonstrating that one can pass through such loss and remain faithful? Or is that importing meaning the text doesn't carry?\
The sign function seems clear: 
\f2 \uc0\u1499 \u1456 \u1468 \u1499 \u1465 \u1500 
\f1  
\f2 \uc0\u1488 \u1458 \u1513 \u1462 \u1473 \u1512 \u1470 \u1506 \u1464 \u1513 \u1464 \u1474 \u1492 
