\f1  - "I will not relent, I will not spare, I will not be comforted." These close off escape from judgment.\
But the positive declarations frame them:\

\f2 \uc0\u1488 \u1458 \u1504 \u1460 \u1497 
\f1  
\f2 \uc0\u1497 \u1456 \u1492 \u1465 \u1493 \u1464 \u1492 
