\cf2 On the corruption in contents versus pot: I think your evidence is persuasive that verse 6 points toward corrupted contents. The proverb-counter-proverb structure makes sense of this - they said "we are the good meat," and the counter says "no, you are rotten meat that no one would want." The gambling reference (
