Ezekiel loses what is precious to him so that he can signify what the people will experience. YHWH gives up what is His (the sanctuary) and takes from Ezekiel what is his (his wife) for the same purpose - that they will know.\
What does it reveal about YHWH that He works this way?\
That recognition - 
\f2 \uc0\u1493 \u1456 \u1497 \u1464 \u1491 \u1456 \u1506 \u1493 \u1468 
\f1  
\f2 \uc0\u1499 \u1460 \u1468 \u1497 
