\f1  - "Behold, I am profaning MY sanctuary." YHWH removes His own holiness from the place. He refuses to let His presence be security for a blood-city. He gives up His dwelling place rather than be complicit in what they've become. And yet - the same God will fill a new temple with His glory. The profaning serves the larger purpose.\
\ls17\ilvl0
\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
