This principle applies to everything YHWH has spoken. The same faithfulness that ensures judgment ensures restoration. The same word that brings death will bring life to dry bones. When you read the three negations, don't miss that they are grounded in YHWH's character as the God whose word accomplishes what it declares - in both directions.\

